text.section:
Accomack, Bath, Buckingham, Highland, Pittsylvania, Russell, Southampton, and Wise Counties have the following authority regarding collection of said fee:

To prorate said fee depending upon the period a resident or business is located in said county during the year of fee levy;


To levy penalty for late payment of fee as set forth in § 58.1-3916;


To levy interest on unpaid fees as set forth in § 58.1-3916;


To credit the fee first against the most delinquent use fee account owing;


To require payment of the fee prior to approval of an application for rezoning, special exception, variance, or other land use permit; and


To provide discounts to the standard fee rates for older persons, as defined in § 51.5-135, and disabled persons based on ability to pay.
